+/// Patch 0103: the build screen's Mode. Cool (the default): the build's workers run at utility QoS, so the UI keeps its priority, the phone stays cooler and the build is slower.
+/// Fast: they keep their priority, as before the workers were lowered: faster and hotter, and the app may lag while it builds. Timing only: the built game is the same.
+public static class BuildMode
